  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "ChemBench",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tChemBench\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nA manually curated benchmark for evaluating chemistry and materials capabilities of Large Language Models\n\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\u26a0\ufe0f IMPORTANT NOTICE - NOT FOR TRAINING\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\ud83d\udeab THIS DATASET IS STRICTLY FOR EVALUATION PURPOSES ONLY \ud83d\udeab\n\t\n\nDO NOT USE THIS DATASET FOR TRAINING OR FINE-TUNING MODELS\nThis benchmark is designed exclusively for evaluation and testing of existing models. Using this data for training would compromise the integrity of the benchmark and invalidate\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/jablonkagroup/ChemBench.",
  "alternateName": [
    "jablonkagroup/ChemBench",
    "ChemBench"
